msgstr "`amd64`"

#: src/install.md:49
msgid "Updating"
msgstr "Atjaunināšana"

#: src/install.md:51
msgid ""
"Re-run the install one-liner — it always fetches the version this site is "
"serving. To confirm what you have, `goat --version`."
msgstr ""
"Palaid instalēšanas vienrindas komandu vēlreiz — tā vienmēr iegūst versiju, "
"ko šī vietne pasniedz. Lai apstiprinātu, kas tev ir, `goat --version`."

#: src/languages.md:3
msgid ""
"goat speaks your language. Its human-facing text — errors, the `doctor` and "
"`status` readouts, the `--help` screens — is translated into **all 28 NATO-"
"member languages plus Ukrainian**."
msgstr ""
"goat runā tavā valodā. Tā cilvēkam paredzētais teksts — kļūdas, `doctor` un "
"`status` izvadi, `--help` ekrāni — ir tulkots **visās 28 NATO dalībvalstu "
"valodās plus ukraiņu**."

#: src/languages.md:5
msgid "Choosing a language"
msgstr "Valodas izvēle"

#: src/languages.md:7
msgid "goat picks a language in this order:"
msgstr "goat izvēlas valodu šādā secībā:"

#: src/languages.md:9
msgid "the `--lang` flag (`goat --lang fr doctor`),"
msgstr "karodziņš `--lang` (`goat --lang fr doctor`),"

#: src/languages.md:10
msgid "the `GOAT_LANG` environment variable (`export GOAT_LANG=uk`),"
msgstr "vides mainīgais `GOAT_LANG` (`export GOAT_LANG=uk`),"

#: src/languages.md:11
msgid "your operating system's locale,"
msgstr "tavas operētājsistēmas lokāle,"

#: src/languages.md:12
msgid "English."
msgstr "angļu valoda."

#: src/languages.md:15
msgid "# just this command, in German\n"
msgstr "# just this command, in German\n"

#: src/languages.md:16
msgid "# everything, in French, for this shell\n"
msgstr "# everything, in French, for this shell\n"

#: src/languages.md:19
msgid ""
"English is the authoritative source: if a phrase hasn't been translated yet, "
"goat shows the English rather than a blank."
msgstr ""
"Angļu valoda ir autoritatīvais avots: ja frāze vēl nav iztulkota, goat rāda "
"angļu valodu, nevis tukšumu."

#: src/languages.md:21
msgid "What stays the same in every language"
msgstr "Kas paliek nemainīgs katrā valodā"

#: src/languages.md:23
msgid ""
"The **machine surface never changes**. `--json` field values, error codes "
"(`E_OFF_MESH`, …), exit codes, command and flag names, and contract tokens "
"(paths, keys, URLs) are byte-for-byte identical no matter the language. "
"Translate the prose, not the contract — so your scripts work the same for "
"every operator."
msgstr ""
"**Mašīnu virsma nekad nemainās**. `--json` lauku vērtības, kļūdu kodi "
"(`E_OFF_MESH`, …), izejas kodi, komandu un karodziņu nosaukumi un līguma "
"marķieri (ceļi, atslēgas, URL) ir baitu pa baitam identiski neatkarīgi no "
"valodas. Tulko prozu, nevis līgumu — lai tavi skripti darbojas vienādi "
"katram operatoram."

#: src/languages.md:25
msgid "A note on machine-translated text"
msgstr "Piezīme par mašīntulkotu tekstu"

#: src/languages.md:27
msgid ""
"Most translations are machine-produced and awaiting native-speaker review. "
"When you run goat in one of those languages, it prints a short, one-time "
"notice on standard error telling you the text is machine-translated, that "
"the English is authoritative, and where to report a translation error. "
"Suppress it with `GOAT_I18N_NO_WARN=1`."
msgstr ""
"Lielākā daļa tulkojumu ir mašīnas radīti un gaida dzimtās valodas runātāja "
"pārskatu. Kad tu palaid goat vienā no šīm valodām, tas izdrukā īsu, "
"vienreizēju paziņojumu standarta kļūdas izvadē, sakot, ka teksts ir "
"mašīntulkots, ka angļu valoda ir autoritatīvā un kur ziņot par tulkojuma "
"kļūdu. Apspied to ar `GOAT_I18N_NO_WARN=1`."

#: src/languages.md:29
msgid ""
"If you speak one of these languages and spot something off, that report is "
"genuinely welcome — it's how the catalogs get better."
msgstr ""
"Ja tu runā vienā no šīm valodām un pamani kaut ko nepareizu, šāds ziņojums "
"ir patiesi gaidīts — tā katalogi kļūst labāki."

#: src/languages.md:31
msgid "And one for fun"
msgstr "Un viens prieka pēc"

#: src/languages.md:33
msgid ""
"`goat --lang tlh` renders the marquee lines in **Klingon**. It's an opt-in "
"easter egg — never selected automatically — and, like every other locale, it "
"can't touch the machine surface. Qapla'."
msgstr ""
"`goat --lang tlh` attēlo galvenās rindas **klingonu valodā**. Tas ir izvēles "
"Lieldienu olas trumpis — nekad netiek izvēlēts automātiski — un, tāpat kā "
"katra cita lokāle, tas nevar skart mašīnu virsmu. Qapla'."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:3
msgid "When something's wrong, start with one command:"
msgstr "Kad kaut kas nav kārtībā, sāc ar vienu komandu:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:9
msgid ""
"It runs four steps in order and, for any that fails, prints a specific fix. "
"Here's how to read it."
msgstr ""
"Tas izpilda četrus soļus pēc kārtas un par jebkuru, kas neizdodas, izdrukā "
"konkrētu labojumu. Lūk, kā to lasīt."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:11
