msgstr "Solis"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "What it checks"
msgstr "Ko tas pārbauda"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "If it fails"
msgstr "Ja tas neizdodas"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "**mesh**"
msgstr "**mesh**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "You're on the fabric's network"
msgstr "Tu esi fabric tīklā"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "You're off-mesh — bring up your tunnel (`netbird status` / re-enroll)"
msgstr ""
"Tu esi ārpus mesh — pacel savu tuneli (`netbird status` / reģistrējies no "
"jauna)"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid "**router**"
msgstr "**router**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid "The fabric's router is reachable"
msgstr "fabric maršrutētājs ir sasniedzams"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid ""
"The router may be down, or your endpoint is wrong — re-check your profile"
msgstr ""
"Maršrutētājs var būt nedarbojas, vai tava galapunkts ir nepareizs — pārbaudi "
"savu profilu vēlreiz"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "**certificate**"
msgstr "**sertifikāts**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "Your identity is accepted"
msgstr "Tava identitāte ir pieņemta"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid ""
"Your cert may be expired or rejected — `goat profile show`, then re-onboard "
"if needed"
msgstr ""
"Tavs sertifikāts var būt beidzies vai noraidīts — `goat profile show`, tad "
"reģistrējies no jauna, ja nepieciešams"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "**portal**"
msgstr "**portāls**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "Your access token works"
msgstr "Tavs piekļuves marķieris darbojas"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "Token expired or revoked — ask to be re-onboarded"
msgstr "Marķieris beidzies vai atsaukts — lūdz, lai tevi reģistrē no jauna"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:20
msgid ""
"Each failed step exits with a distinct code, so a wrapper script can branch "
"without parsing text."
msgstr ""
"Katrs neizdevies solis iziet ar atšķirīgu kodu, tāpēc apvalka skripts var "
"sazaroties bez teksta parsēšanas."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:22
msgid "Common situations"
msgstr "Biežākās situācijas"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:24
msgid ""
"**\"off the ZTOL — not connected to the mesh\"** You're not on the fabric's "
"network. Bring up your mesh tunnel and try again; `goat doctor` will confirm "
"once you're on."
msgstr ""
"**\"off the ZTOL — not connected to the mesh\"** Tu neesi fabric tīklā. "
"Pacel savu mesh tuneli un mēģini vēlreiz; `goat doctor` apstiprinās, kad "
"būsi pieslēdzies."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:27
msgid ""
"**\"mTLS cert expired or rejected by the router\"** Your identity is stale. "
"`goat profile show` to see its expiry; if it's past, you'll need a fresh "
"bundle."
msgstr ""
"**\"mTLS cert expired or rejected by the router\"** Tava identitāte ir "
"novecojusi. `goat profile show`, lai redzētu tā derīguma termiņu; ja tas "
"pagājis, tev būs vajadzīgs jauns bundle."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:30
msgid ""
"**\"portal rejected the Bearer token\"** Your access token is no longer "
"valid (expired or revoked). Ask your administrator to re-onboard you."
msgstr ""
"**\"portal rejected the Bearer token\"** Tavs piekļuves marķieris vairs nav "
"derīgs (beidzies vai atsaukts). Lūdz savam administratoram reģistrēt tevi no "
"jauna."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:33
msgid ""
"**`goat status` shows a `[✗]`** `status` is the one-glance view; run `goat "
"doctor` for the stepped detail and the specific remedy."
msgstr ""
"**`goat status` rāda `[✗]`** `status` ir viena skatiena pārskats; palaid "
"`goat doctor`, lai iegūtu pakāpenisku detalizāciju un konkrēto risinājumu."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:36
msgid ""
"**`goat status` shows `ztol` green but `session` red** The router port accepts connections, but a Zenoh session does not open: the router is wedged, or it rejects your certificate. A mesh bounce does not fix this. Run `goat doctor` and tell your administrator."
msgstr ""
"**`goat status` rāda `ztol` zaļu, bet `session` sarkanu** Maršrutētāja ports pieņem savienojumus, bet Zenoh sesija neatveras: maršrutētājs ir iestrēdzis vai noraida jūsu sertifikātu. Mesh savienojuma restartēšana to nenovērš. Palaidiet `goat doctor` un informējiet savu administratoru."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:39
msgid "Understanding an error code"
msgstr "Kļūdas koda izpratne"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:38
msgid "Every error carries a stable code (like `E_OFF_MESH`). To look one up:"
msgstr ""
"Katra kļūda satur stabilu kodu (piemēram, `E_OFF_MESH`). Lai to uzmeklētu:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:44
msgid "Practice without risk"
msgstr "Prakse bez riska"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:46
msgid ""
"If you just want to explore commands without touching anything real, the "
"sandbox is always there:"
msgstr ""
"Ja vēlies vienkārši izpētīt komandas, neskarot neko īstu, smilškaste vienmēr "
"ir tur:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:53
msgid "Still stuck?"
msgstr "Joprojām iestrēdzis?"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:55
msgid ""
"Capture the exact command and its output (use `--json` for a clean, complete "
"record) and bring it to your goat administrator."
msgstr ""
"Notver precīzo komandu un tās izvadi (izmanto `--json` tīram, pilnīgam "
"ierakstam) un aiznes to savam goat administratoram."

#: src/admin.md:3
msgid ""
"`goat admin` is the operator surface: onboarding and revoking participants, "
"rotating certificates, cutting a misbehaving peer off the mesh, provisioning "
"devices, and LAN-side triage. It sits apart from the everyday commands on "
"purpose."
msgstr ""
"`goat admin` ir operatora saskarne: dalībnieku pievienošana un atsaukšana, "
"sertifikātu rotācija, problemātiska vienādranga atvienošana no tīkla, ierīču "
"nodrošināšana un LAN puses diagnostika. Tas ir apzināti nošķirts no ikdienas "
"komandām."

#: src/admin.md:5
msgid ""
"**Operator-only.** These commands are for operators who hold admin "
"credentials. If you're a participant publishing and subscribing on the "
"fabric, this chapter isn't your day-to-day — your surface is **[Everyday "
"tasks](everyday.md)** (`goat pub` / `sub` / `top` / `who` / `health`). `goat "
"admin` is **inert for non-admins**: an unauthorized call changes nothing and "
"tells you so."
msgstr ""
"**Tikai operatoriem.** Šīs komandas paredzētas operatoriem, kuriem ir "
"administratora akreditācijas dati. Ja esat dalībnieks, kas publicē un abonē "
"audumā, šī nodaļa nav jūsu ikdiena — jūsu saskarne ir **[Ikdienas uzdevumi]"
"(everyday.md)** (`goat pub` / `sub` / `top` / `who` / `health`). `goat "
"admin` **nav aktīvs neadministratoriem**: neautorizēts izsaukums neko "
"nemaina un paziņo par to."

#: src/admin.md:7
msgid "What \"operator-only\" means in practice"
msgstr "Ko \"tikai operatoriem\" nozīmē praksē"

#: src/admin.md:9
msgid ""
"The authority isn't in the CLI — it's in _your credentials_. `goat` itself "
"is a thin client; whether you may onboard an org or eject a peer is decided "
"by what your operator profile and environment carry, and confirmed by the "
"portal and the NetBird management API. So an admin command can stop in two "
"honest places:"
msgstr ""
"Pilnvaras nav CLI — tās ir _jūsu akreditācijas datos_. `goat` pats ir plāns "
"klients; vai drīkstat pievienot organizāciju vai izslēgt vienādranga mezglu, "
"nosaka jūsu operatora profils un vide, ko apstiprina portāls un NetBird "
"pārvaldības API. Tāpēc administratora komanda var apstāties divos godīgos "
"punktos:"

#: src/admin.md:11
msgid ""
"**Up front, before anything is sent.** If your machine has no operator setup "
"at all — no initialized profile and no operator environment — `goat admin` "
"refuses immediately with `E_NOT_ADMIN`. Nothing leaves your laptop."
msgstr ""
"**Sākumā, pirms kaut kas tiek nosūtīts.** Ja jūsu datoram nav neviena "
"operatora iestatījuma — nav inicializēta profila un nav operatora vides — "
"`goat admin` nekavējoties atsakās ar `E_NOT_ADMIN`. Nekas nepametīs jūsu "
"klēpjdatoru."

#: src/admin.md:12
msgid ""
"**Server-side, at the action.** If you do have credentials but they aren't "
"authorized for this action, the portal or NetBird returns a refusal. A "
"refused _mutation_ means nothing changed — and `goat` reports it as "
"`E_NOT_ADMIN`, not as a vague token error."
msgstr ""
"**Servera pusē, pie darbības.** Ja jums ir akreditācijas dati, bet tie nav "
"autorizēti šai darbībai, portāls vai NetBird atgriež atteikumu. Atteikta "
"_mutācija_ nozīmē, ka nekas nav mainījies — un `goat` to ziņo kā "
"`E_NOT_ADMIN`, nevis kā neskaidru tokena kļūdu."

#: src/admin.md:14
msgid "Two error codes you'll want to tell apart:"
msgstr "Divi kļūdu kodi, kurus vēlēsieties atšķirt:"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "Code"
msgstr "Kods"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Nozīme"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "What to do"
msgstr "Ko darīt"

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid "`E_NOT_ADMIN`"
msgstr "`E_NOT_ADMIN`"

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid ""
"Your credential is **valid but not authorized** for this action (or no "
"operator credential is configured)."
msgstr ""
"Jūsu akreditācijas dati ir **derīgi, bet nav autorizēti** šai darbībai (vai "
"nav konfigurēts neviens operatora akreditācijas datu kopums)."

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid ""
"Confirm you're on your operator profile and have sourced your operator "
"environment. If you still can't, this action isn't for your role — contact "
"your goat administrator. Re-onboarding won't change it."
msgstr ""
"Pārliecinieties, ka izmantojat operatora profilu un esat aktivizējuši "
"operatora vidi. Ja joprojām nevarat, šī darbība nav paredzēta jūsu lomai — "
"sazinieties ar savu goat administratoru. Atkārtota pievienošana to nemainīs."

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "`E_TOKEN_INVALID`"
msgstr "`E_TOKEN_INVALID`"

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "Your credential is **expired or bad** (HTTP 401)."
msgstr ""
"Jūsu akreditācijas dati ir **beiguši derīguma termiņu vai bojāti** (HTTP "
"401)."

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "Re-onboard to get a fresh token."
msgstr "Atkārtoti pievienojieties, lai iegūtu jaunu tokenu."

#: src/admin.md:21
msgid ""
"Reading about admin is never gated: `goat admin --help` and `goat admin "
"<cmd> --help` always work, in every language. Only _running_ an action is "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"Lasīšana par administrēšanu nekad nav ierobežota: `goat admin --help` un "
"`goat admin <cmd> --help` vienmēr darbojas, jebkurā valodā. Tikai _darbības "
"izpilde_ tiek pārbaudīta."

#: src/admin.md:23
msgid "The commands"
msgstr "Komandas"

#: src/admin.md:25
msgid ""
"Add `--help` to any of these for the full flag set, or see the **[Command "
"reference](reference.md)** — the details there are generated from the "
"binary, so they always match what you're running."
msgstr ""
"Pievienojiet `--help` jebkurai no šīm komandām, lai iegūtu pilnu karodziņu "
"sarakstu, vai skatiet **[Komandu uzziņu](reference.md)** — tur esošā "
"informācija tiek ģenerēta no bināra faila, tāpēc tā vienmēr atbilst jūsu "
"palaistajam."

#: src/admin.md:41
msgid "A few notes:"
msgstr "Dažas piezīmes:"

#: src/admin.md:43
msgid ""
"**`lan` is the break-glass diagnostic.** `scan` and `doctor` mutate nothing, "
"need no credentials, and are built to work when the mesh and every service "
"are down — so they're the one part of `goat admin` that isn't refused for a "
"missing operator environment."
msgstr ""
"**`lan` ir ārkārtas diagnostikas rīks.** `scan` un `doctor` neko nemaina, "
"neprasa akreditācijas datus un ir veidoti darbam, kad tīkls un visi "
"pakalpojumi ir pieejami — tāpēc tā ir vienīgā `goat admin` daļa, kas netiek "
"atteikta trūkstoša operatora vides dēļ."

#: src/admin.md:44
msgid ""
"**`rotate` keeps identity fixed.** It re-issues the leaf certificate for the "
"same anchor, alias, write namespace, and ACL — only the cert and key are "
"new. Use it for renewal or re-keying, not for changing who someone is."
msgstr ""
"**`rotate` saglabā identitāti nemainīgu.** Tas atkārtoti izsniedz lapas "
"sertifikātu tam pašam enkuram, aizstājvārdam, rakstīšanas nosaukumtelpai un "
"ACL — tikai sertifikāts un atslēga ir jauni. Izmantojiet to atjaunošanai vai "
"atslēgas maiņai, nevis personas maiņai."

#: src/admin.md:45
msgid ""
"**`peer cut` is the real cut.** On the brokerless fabric a certificate is "
"inert without a mesh path, so removing the _peer_ is what stops a flooder — "
"`goat health` finds it, `goat admin peer cut` ejects it."
msgstr ""
"**`peer cut` ir īstais atdalīšanas rīks.** Brokerless audumā sertifikāts ir "
"neaktīvs bez tīkla ceļa, tāpēc _vienādranga mezgla_ noņemšana ir tas, kas "
"aptur plūdinātāju — `goat health` to atrod, `goat admin peer cut` to izslēdz."

#: src/admin.md:46
msgid ""
"**Destructive actions confirm first.** `org delete`, `peer cut`, and the `--"
"org` cascades print what they're about to do and ask before acting (`--yes` "
"to skip, `--dry-run` to preview)."
msgstr ""
"**Destruktīvas darbības vispirms apstiprina.** `org delete`, `peer cut` un `-"
"-org` kaskādes izdrukā, ko tās gatavojas darīt, un pieprasa apstiprinājumu "
"pirms darbības (`--yes`, lai izlaistu, `--dry-run`, lai priekšskatītu)."

#: src/admin.md:48
msgid "If you see `E_NOT_ADMIN`"
msgstr "Ja redzat `E_NOT_ADMIN`"

#: src/admin.md:50
msgid "Nothing was changed. Walk through it:"
msgstr "Nekas netika mainīts. Pārbaudiet secīgi:"

#: src/admin.md:52
msgid ""
"**Are you on your operator profile?** `goat context use <name>` selects it; "
"`goat profile show` confirms which one is active."
msgstr ""
"**Vai izmantojat operatora profilu?** `goat context use <name>` to izvēlas; "
"`goat profile show` apstiprina, kurš ir aktīvs."

#: src/admin.md:53
msgid ""
"**Have you sourced your operator environment?** Admin actions read operator "
"credentials from the environment (for example `GOAT_OPERATOR_HANDLE` and the "
"NetBird admin token) — never from the profile on disk."
msgstr ""
"**Vai esat aktivizējuši operatora vidi?** Administratora darbības lasa "
"operatora akreditācijas datus no vides (piemēram, `GOAT_OPERATOR_HANDLE` un "
"NetBird administratora tokenu) — nekad no profila diskā."

#: src/admin.md:54
msgid ""
"**Should you have this access at all?** If you've checked the above and the "
"portal still refuses, your role isn't authorized for this action. Contact "
"your goat administrator — re-onboarding the same identity won't grant it."
msgstr ""
"**Vai jums vispār vajadzētu būt šai piekļuvei?** Ja esat pārbaudījuši "
"iepriekš minēto un portāls joprojām atsakās, jūsu loma nav autorizēta šai "
"darbībai. Sazinieties ar savu goat administratoru — atkārtota tās pašas "
"identitātes pievienošana to nepiešķirs."

#: src/admin.md:56
msgid "The full operator workflow"
msgstr "Pilns operatora darbplūsmas apraksts"

#: src/admin.md:58
msgid ""
"This chapter orients you to the surface and how it behaves. The end-to-end "
"operator workflow — the capability model, setting up your environment and "
"certificates, and the onboard / revoke / rotate / audit loop — lives in the "
"**admin-operator guide** that ships with your goatnet's operations docs, not "
"in this book."
msgstr ""
"Šī nodaļa iepazīstina ar saskarni un tās uzvedību. Pilna operatora "
"darbplūsma — iespēju modelis, vides un sertifikātu iestatīšana, kā arī "
"pievienošanas / atsaukšanas / rotācijas / audita cikls — atrodas **admin-"
"operatora rokasgrāmatā**, kas tiek piegādāta ar jūsu goatnet operāciju "
"dokumentāciju, nevis šajā grāmatā."

