#: src/concepts.md:9
msgid ""
"You join with an **identity**: an onboarding _bundle_ that carries your "
"certificate, an access token, and where the fabric lives. The fabric admits "
"you by _who you are_, not by a shared password. `goat ca add <bundle-"
"ca.pem>` tells goat which CA to trust — it ships trusting none — and `goat "
"profile init <bundle.cbor>` then installs that identity; you can hold "
"several under different _contexts_ and switch between them."
msgstr ""
"Jūs pievienojaties ar **identitāti**: iekļaušanas _paketi_, kas satur jūsu sertifikātu, piekļuves marķieri un to, kur atrodas fabric. Fabric jūs pielaiž pēc tā, _kas jūs esat_, nevis pēc koplietotas paroles. `goat ca add <bundle-ca.pem>` pasaka goat, kurai CA uzticēties — tas tiek piegādāts, neuzticoties nevienai — un `goat profile init <bundle.cbor>` pēc tam instalē šo identitāti; jūs varat turēt vairākas dažādos _kontekstos_ un pārslēgties starp tām."

#: src/getting-started.md:50
msgid ""
"The first line is not optional. `goat` ships trusting **no** goatnet, so "
"`profile init` refuses until you add the root that signed your bundle — the "
"`-ca.pem` ships beside the `.cbor` it verifies. `goat ca add` prints a "
"fingerprint; check it against one your operator gives you before relying on "
"it, because a bundle that reached you over a channel proves only that the "
"channel delivered it. `goat ca ls` shows what you trust; one binary works "
"against every goatnet whose root you have added."
msgstr ""
"Pirmā rinda nav izvēles. `goat` tiek piegādāts, neuzticoties **nevienam** goatnet, tāpēc `profile init` atsakās, līdz pievienojat sakni, kas parakstīja jūsu paketi — `-ca.pem` tiek piegādāts blakus `.cbor`, ko tas pārbauda. `goat ca add` izdrukā pirkstu nospiedumu; salīdziniet to ar to, ko jums iedod operators, pirms uz to paļaujaties, jo pakete, kas jūs sasniedza pa kanālu, pierāda tikai to, ka kanāls to piegādāja. `goat ca ls` parāda, kam jūs uzticaties; viens binārs darbojas ar katru goatnet, kura sakni esat pievienojis."
